OL,3,GNEWSAGirls fear real life consequences 
OL,4,Aof misogyny                            
OL,6,FEmily, 16, said there should be "more  
OL,7,Fserious consequences" for men sharing  
OL,8,Fmisogynist attitudes with younger boys 
OL,9,F"because it really looks like things   
OL,10,Faren't going to change in my lifetime".
